{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>曾與《中年好聲音4》參賽者尹景順合唱《別問我是誰》的王馨平，公開表示已視他為本屆冠軍，但尹景順本人卻驚人自揭，他一直以來表現出的「佛系」輕鬆參賽心態，背後竟是源於極度的自卑感！他更語出驚人地表示會認同黑粉的留言，究竟是怎樣的一種心態？</p><p>王馨平睇好奪冠 尹景順分享放鬆心態秘訣</p><p>獲得前輩王馨平點名睇好，尹景順坦言自己曾參加過很多歌唱比賽，每一次都抱著想贏的心態，但若未能晉級便會感到非常失望，甚至一度想過要放棄唱歌。正是這些經歷，讓他學會了放鬆心態去面對比賽，不再將勝負看得太重，反而更能享受舞台，發揮出超乎預期的水準，成就了今天觀眾眼中的「佛系」唱將。</p><p>驚揭「佛系」源於自卑 尹景順：有一個人鍾意我已好開心</p><p>然而，尹景順進一步剖白，原來「佛系」的背後，竟是源於根深蒂固的自卑感。他極度坦誠地說：「我係一個比較自卑嘅人！一向嘅諗法係全世界唔係咁鍾意我，如果有一個人鍾意我，哪怕淨係一個人鍾意我，我已經好開心。」這番話揭示了他謙卑甚至有點悲觀的內心世界，因為不抱期望，所以任何一點支持都顯得彌足珍貴。</p><p>面對黑粉攻擊唔受打擊 尹景順：反而提醒咗我</p><p>基於這種自卑心態，尹景順面對網絡上的「黑粉」攻擊時，竟有著與眾不同的看法。他坦言某程度上會認同那些負面留言，因此並不會受到太大打擊。他解釋道：「反而佢哋提醒咗我，我會有啲咁嘅嘢。」他將惡意批評內化為一種自我鞭策的提醒，展現出極高的情商和與眾不同的成熟心態，令人佩服。</p><p>網民大讚心態成熟：「呢種境界唔係人人有！」</p><p>尹景順的深度剖白引起網民極大迴響。「原來佛系背後有咁嘅故事，好心痛。」「將黑粉留言當提醒，呢個EQ太高！」「景順嘅歌聲好有故事，而家明白點解了。」「欣賞佢嘅坦白，呢種境界唔係人人有！冠軍之選！」</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/01_19123335596a891a0ecd5e4.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/02_4362229086a891a14241ff.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/03_21226785506a891a174c182.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/04_2992016186a891a1b42684.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/05_5544507966a891a1f729cc.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/06_15814567776a891a239be8d.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/07_6174844576a891a287213d.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/08_830219986a891a2bdd834.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/09_3662474496a891a304ca18.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/10_20662449256a891a348e493.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/11_6034776526a891a3845ed4.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/12_8686359816a891a3c5d836.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/13_13991516626a891a404a95a.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/14_10710008136a891a4493b84.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/15_15941161436a891a486c48b.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/16_13172942306a891a4e37af9.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/17_16353173896a891a519efaa.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/18_10925401496a891a555c6cb.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/19_2510129436a891a58bfc7d.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/20_12885185476a891a5d07b6c.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/21_2789813016a891a610d223.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" sr